{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 43","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_43\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 43</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_43\">Problem 43</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 43\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of scalene triangles having all sides of integral lengths, and perimeter less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/7/94764504008356455c4c8c630375ebcabfac8d31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write all possible triangles adding up to 12 or less\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bbc03127e4c72fcaad5be80302568ca35e99e88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2, 4, 5)=11\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/3/ab37dcd4ceec9d18ccec45f590018d0f7ce958ef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3, 4, 5)=12\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/dde94fcb1ea507def8fcdac780fa153011918fb4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2, 3, 4)=9\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0f2f94b3a2937280f51eb99e0b8130557aac69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} \\quad 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"66\" height=\"28\" /> scalene triangles.\n</p><p>-coolmath34\n</p><p>-rubslul\n</p><p>(If you see any cases I missed out, edit them in.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LYFaYLiLTXE\">https://youtu.be/LYFaYLiLTXE</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">Problem 42</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">Problem 44</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Proble